# CODEOWNERS — automatic PR reviewer assignment.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Syntax: <path-pattern> <@owner1> <@owner2>  ...
# Last matching pattern wins. Patterns follow .gitignore syntax.
#
# Place this file at one of: .github/CODEOWNERS, docs/CODEOWNERS, or repo root.
# GitHub also honours BitBucket's location (.bitbucket/CODEOWNERS).

# Default owners — required on every PR.
# *           @your-org/maintainers

# Backend
# /backend/    @your-org/backend-team
# /api/        @your-org/backend-team

# Frontend
# /frontend/   @your-org/frontend-team
# /web/        @your-org/frontend-team

# Infrastructure
# /infra/      @your-org/platform-team
# /.github/    @your-org/platform-team
# Dockerfile   @your-org/platform-team

# Docs
# *.md         @your-org/docs-team
# /docs/       @your-org/docs-team

# Security-critical paths — require security review.
# /auth/       @your-org/security
# *secret*     @your-org/security
